    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Boutique Builder Simulator \u2013 Design, Manage, and Build Your Dream Boutique!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the glamorous world of fashion and retail with <strong>Boutique Builder Simulator</strong>, where you\u2019re the boss of your very own boutique! Start from scratch and grow your store into a thriving fashion empire.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Boutique</strong>: Customize every detail of your shop, from layouts and decor to product displays, creating a unique shopping experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock the Hottest Trends</strong>: Choose from a wide range of clothing and accessories to keep your customers coming back for more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Like a Pro</strong>: Handle inventory, set prices, and ensure your store runs smoothly as you grow your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Features</strong>: Expand your boutique with upgrades, unlock stylish new items, and take on exciting challenges as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with Customers</strong>: Help shoppers find their perfect outfits, deal with quirky customer requests, and keep them happy to boost sales!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player or a strategy fan, <strong>Boutique Builder Simulator</strong> offers hours of fun and creativity. Are you ready to become the ultimate boutique boss?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Boutique Builder Simulator \u2013 Design, Manage, and Build Your Dream Boutique!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the glamorous world of fashion and retail with <strong>Boutique Builder Simulator</strong>, where you\u2019re the boss of your very own boutique! Start from scratch and grow your store into a thriving fashion empire.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Boutique</strong>: Customize every detail of your shop, from layouts and decor to product displays, creating a unique shopping experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock the Hottest Trends</strong>: Choose from a wide range of clothing and accessories to keep your customers coming back for more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Like a Pro</strong>: Handle inventory, set prices, and ensure your store runs smoothly as you grow your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Features</strong>: Expand your boutique with upgrades, unlock stylish new items, and take on exciting challenges as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with Customers</strong>: Help shoppers find their perfect outfits, deal with quirky customer requests, and keep them happy to boost sales!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player or a strategy fan, <strong>Boutique Builder Simulator</strong> offers hours of fun and creativity. Are you ready to become the ultimate boutique boss?</p>",
